+The TDS extension is a browser extension. On claude.ai, chatgpt.com and gemini.google.com, it finds personal data in the text you type or paste into the chat box, such as e-mail addresses, phone numbers, Swedish personal identity numbers and some names. It also hides a birth date written next to a word such as "born" or "date of birth". Before you send, it replaces that data with placeholders such as `⟦PERSON_1⟧`. When the answer comes back, it can show the real values again on your screen.
+
